abstract: >-
  Overview of the Reconstructed Differential Evolution series: RDE (IEEE WCCI/CEC 2024,
  Runner-Up Award), RDEx (IEEE CEC 2025, rank 1 in all four tracks) and RDE26 (IEEE
  WCCI/CEC 2026, rank 1 in all four tracks), with links to the repositories and papers.
